+    matched-model estimator therefore beats the production centroid on
+    every axis measured here, by a wide margin, and still loses on real
+    rendered audio (where a released piano note's envelope is not one
+    exponential). The assertion below states that gap in the direction
+    that matters: clearing these bars is NOT sufficient evidence to ship.
+    If a future change ever makes the candidate stop dominating here, this
+    test goes red and the reasoning in the C10C report has to be redone
+    from scratch."""
